  "name": "Chicken Gyros",
  "subtitle": "Spiced yogurt-marinated chicken with fresh vegetables",
  "description": "Layered chicken thighs are marinated with yogurt, citrus, garlic, and warm spices, then cooked until tender and sliced for serving with onions and tomatoes.",
